# Next to the Dockerfile, so it applies with either build context (the repo root or this folder); hence the **/ patterns.
**/.git
**/.superpowers
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/public/js
**/public/app.css
**/public/vendor
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.zip
**/.DS_Store
# Building from the repo root: leave out the other apps. (No other root-only entries: from the zip, the context is
# this folder, and a pattern like "scripts" would drop the app's own scripts/.)
apps/*
!apps/atlassian-notes
